{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"The circular says the measures “will take immediate effect” in unit d97b56331f41a.u1.190, while its Implementation section says the measures in the FAQs take effect on 28 November 2025 in unit d97b56331f41a.u9.1696. Both candidates impose the latter date without resolving that tension.\",\"The transition sentence says pending earlier applications follow the existing process. It does not expressly make every change associated with such an application permanently ineligible for item (ii) relief, or specify the date on which pending status must be tested.\",\"Neither candidate computes whether prior SFC approval is required when relief is unavailable. Their false outcomes correctly avoid that inference; the existing approval process and relevant FAQs are needed for a fuller duty determination.\",\"The relevant FAQs, forms and checklists are referenced but not supplied. Their contents cannot be inferred from the two unbound dependency records, whose source hashes are null.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular itself states this SFC power; no additional authority is needed to assess the quoted claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.04ad83aa3d5a46613db4d337\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule tests relief eligibility, not the SFC's response to non-compliance.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"This downstream enforcement permission does not determine the selected change's eligibility for removal of prior approval.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular expressly grants the stated discretionary response to non-compliance.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular supplies its stated aim; no further authority is needed to assess that descriptive claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.0f937493ef455b99dc34078c\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The representation has no separate home-regulator-supervision test. The quoted aim does not establish that one is required.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Do the relevant FAQs make home-regulator supervision a separate eligibility condition for item (ii), beyond compliance with home-jurisdiction requirements?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator’s supervision\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u1.190\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"The aim provides context for the measures, but does not establish a separate condition for this eligibility question.\",\"status\":\"UNCERTAIN\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator’s supervision\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u1.190\"}],\"rationale\":\"The claim accurately reports the stated aim without asserting a distinct eligibility test.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular establishes the transition treatment, but the existing process it invokes is not supplied.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.14d1ca486aa9a3ef294de949\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The fact tracks pre-effective receipt and pending status, but the formula treats that status as an exclusion from relief. The source establishes processing of existing applications under the existing process, not the full reach or duration of the proposed exclusion.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"pending_pre_effective_application: An application concerning the selected change was received by the SFC before 28 November 2025 and had received neither approval nor authorisation by that date. (truth value)\",\"it is not the case that [the fact pending_pre_effective_application]\"],\"status\":\"CONFLICTS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What existing approval or authorisation process governs these applications, and when is the absence of a grant assessed?\",\"Do the relevant FAQs expressly exclude a change associated with a preserved application from item (ii) relief?\",\"How is “will take immediate effect” reconciled with the stated 28 November 2025 Effective Date?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"Application history is expressly part of the typed eligibility question, so the transition matters.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular directly supports continued processing of qualifying existing applications under the existing process.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The exception is in the circular; the relevant FAQs would be needed to resolve undefined feature classifications in a particular case.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.27342c7081d5574225ff9e89\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Negating the disjunction excludes relief if either feature classification is true.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"novel_features: The selected change involves novel product features. (truth value)\",\"complex_features: The selected change involves complex product features. (truth value)\",\"it is not the case that [at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact novel_features; the fact complex_features; the fact possible_local_policy_implications]]\"],\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"How do the relevant FAQs define or assess novel and complex product features for the selected change?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"The exception directly limits the removal being tested.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular expressly excepts changes involving novel or complex features.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The cited FAQs, forms and checklists are external materials whose text is absent; neither null-hash dependency can be identified as the correct catalogue match.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.2b752254450838462896c579\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule does not implement the FAQ, form or checklist contents; this contextual dependency claim is outside its computed result.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Supply the relevant updated FAQs, including the FAQ on SFC Authorization of UCITS Funds, and any forms or checklists material to this eligibility decision.\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"The FAQs may qualify the measure being tested, although their existence is not itself an eligibility condition.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The SFC has updated and published on its website relevant FAQs2 , including a revamped FAQ on SFC Authorization of UCITS Funds to facilitate UCITS fund managers in navigating post-authorisation compliance matters, as well as related forms and checklists3 .\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u7.1419\"},{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular identifies the updated FAQs as setting out the measures and identifies related forms and checklists; their actual contents are not supplied.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular itself states this SFC power; no additional authority is needed to assess the quoted claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.39d91b45fcc48f2f4b1c7ce6\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule does not decide whether non-compliance occurred or what regulatory response the SFC may take.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"This permission concerns consequences of non-compliance, not the selected prior-approval relief conditions.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"rationale\":\"The stated discretionary permission follows directly from the circular.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The external FAQs are identified by the circular but their text and a matched supplied dependency are absent.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.4007eaf36bd54a23c28b361b\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule includes selected conditions but does not encode or establish the contents of the external FAQs.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Supply the updated relevant FAQs to check their operational qualifications and commencement provisions.\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"The FAQs are relevant to interpreting the measure, but the fact that they were published is not a Boolean eligibility condition.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The SFC has updated and published on its website relevant FAQs2 , including a revamped FAQ on SFC Authorization of UCITS Funds\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u7.1419\"},{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular directly states that relevant updated FAQs were published and that they set out the measures.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular supports the general removal, while the referenced FAQs and existing approval process are missing for a definitive operational eligibility determination.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5dd62c5e3141ab3172d44869\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Scope, home compliance and feature exceptions track the claim. The formula's fixed commencement test and categorical pending-application exclusion go beyond what the supplied passages unambiguously establish.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Scope: all of these conditions hold: [the fact defined_ucits_fund; the fact post_authorisation_change; the fact material_investment_change]\",\"Result: all of these conditions hold: [[the fact assessment_date] is greater than or equal to [date value 2025-11-28]; the fact home_requirements_met; it is not the case that [at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact novel_features; the fact complex_features; the fact possible_local_policy_implications]]; it is not the case that [the fact pending_pre_effective_application]]\"],\"status\":\"CONFLICTS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Which event date governs commencement for this change, and how is the circular's “immediate effect” sentence reconciled with 28 November 2025?\",\"Do the FAQs expressly treat a pending pre-effective application as excluding the underlying change from relief, rather than preserving only that application's processing route?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"},{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"This is the central relief claim and includes the transition that the typed question asks about.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"},{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"},{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular supports conditional removal and preservation of processing for existing applications. Its earlier “immediate effect” wording leaves commencement unresolved, and it does not expressly equate preserved application processing with a permanent exclusion of the underlying change.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular supplies the exception; the missing FAQs may inform classification of possible local policy implications.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.64532ece847723d0140be920\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The disjunction makes possible local policy implications sufficient to defeat the result, whether or not feature exceptions also apply.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"possible_local_policy_implications: The selected change may have local policy implications; this asks about possibility, not only established actual effects. (truth value)\",\"it is not the case that [at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact novel_features; the fact complex_features; the fact possible_local_policy_implications]]\"],\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What criteria do the relevant FAQs use to identify a change that may have local policy implications?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"Potential local policy implications are an independent exception to the relief under test.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"}],\"rationale\":\"The “and/or” phrasing supports independent and simultaneous application of the feature and policy exceptions.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular itself states the continuing post-vetting practice.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.074087c89e3a3304960f612e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.6ab5bd31cb78803d6eb0ae1e\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Post-vetting is a distinct downstream process and is not a condition in this relief rule.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The SFC will continue to conduct post-vetting of scheme changes (including those not subject to the SFC’s prior approval) and related revised documents filed with the SFC.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"question_hash\":\"301dbac6537fabe9be4761ef16cb157ca13641f4d3ae4038e3d7965e61711e49\",\"rationale\":\"It limits what may be inferred from relief, but does not determine eligibility for removal of prior approval.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"The SFC will continue to conduct post-vetting of scheme changes (including those not subject to the SFC’s prior approval) and related revised documents filed with the SFC.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"rationale\":\"The quoted sentence directly supports the continuing post-vetting claim.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular states the alignment, but actual notification requirements and periods depend on the missing FAQs and home-jurisdiction rules.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.00787ab10a284a072204b281\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.fd99b0805c0e6bc6f2f87389\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The candidate expressly leaves notification duties unassessed; the rule has no notification condition.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What notification duties, notice periods and content requirements do the relevant FAQs and applicable home-jurisdiction rules specify for this change?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"(iii)      Post-authorisation notifications – To align the SFC’s notification requirements with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, including the notice periods and content requirements.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u6.1221\"}],\"question_hash\":\"9a15824488aefc9b788c86dd28fcf5b92ed5127c4df45c39af0b51987cbfb093\",\"rationale\":\"Notification is a separate post-authorisation matter. Its continued existence does not decide item (ii) prior-approval relief.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"(iii)      Post-authorisation notifications – To align the SFC’s notification requirements with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, including the notice periods and content requirements.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u6.1221\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular supports alignment, while leaving the operative periods and content unspecified.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}}]}"}}
